WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
Rome, the year 144.

2
00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:06.490
A wealthy shipowner is
expelled by the church.

3
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.620
His name is Marcion.

4
00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:13.210
He teaches that the God of the
Hebrew Bible is a harsh, lesser god.

5
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:18.810
So he cuts his Bible down: one shortened
Gospel and ten letters of Paul.

6
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.750
At that time there was no
creed agreed by councils,

7
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.950
and no closed New Testament.

8
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.800
How did the church answer?

9
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:29.960
In this mission, you'll meet three
challenges to early Christian teaching.

10
00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:34.320
Then you'll follow Irenaeus, a
bishop who as a boy heard Polycarp,

11
00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:36.440
a link back to the apostles.

12
00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:40.890
Your mission: find out how the church
answered teachers who called the Creator

13
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.030
a lesser god.
